# Copy to .env for local overrides. .env is gitignored — never commit real values.
#
# The dev server takes its port and host from the environment rather than
# hardcoding one, so `portless frontend-mastery-jobboard -- pnpm dev` works
# without touching vite.config.ts.

# PORT=5173
# HOST=127.0.0.1

# Later stages (module-9 onward) add real service keys here.
# Add the key with a dummy value when you add the stage, never the real one.
